        <body>
            <div xml:id="d30">

                <pb facs="0165" n="49" xml:id="pg49"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.00/561.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-10-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 13, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Americans reported safely out of Hanyang and Wuchang. The native portion of
                    Hangkow reported in flames. Communications cut.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Williams.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
